{"id":"t1-arab-kafa","tahap":"T1","nama":"Bahasa Arab (KAFA)","sk":"Bahasa Arab","ikon":"🕌","warna":"#C0703A","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 1 (ikut e-buku Bahasa Arab Tahun 1)","semak":"pending teacher review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.65","sumber":"Original notes and questions following the lessons of the owner's e-BOOK Bahasa Arab Tahun 1 (JAIS); Arabic vocabulary from the book; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t1-arab-kafa-1","nama":"Huruf hijaiyah dan nombor","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Huruf hijaiyah dan nombor"},{"j":"p","t":"Huruf hijaiyah ada 28 huruf, dari <span class=\"arab\">ا</span> hingga <span class=\"arab\">ي</span>. Kita belajar menyebut, membaca dan menulisnya dengan betul, serta perkataan yang bermula dengan setiap huruf."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">أُمٌّ</span> : ibu","<span class=\"arab\">بَطٌّ</span> : itik","<span class=\"arab\">جَدٌّ</span> : datuk","<span class=\"arab\">دَارٌ</span> : rumah","<span class=\"arab\">زَهْرَةٌ</span> : bunga","<span class=\"arab\">شَمْسٌ</span> : matahari","<span class=\"arab\">طَبِيبٌ</span> : doktor","<span class=\"arab\">كِتَابٌ</span> : buku","<span class=\"arab\">مَسْجِدٌ</span> : masjid","<span class=\"arab\">نَارٌ</span> : api","<span class=\"arab\">هِلَالٌ</span> : anak bulan","<span class=\"arab\">وِسَادَةٌ</span> : bantal"]},{"j":"h","t":"Mengeja perkataan"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كِتَابٌ = كِ + تَا + بٌ</span> · <span class=\"arab\">مَسْجِدٌ = مَسْ + جِدٌ</span>"}],"glosari":[["Huruf hijaiyah","Huruf dalam bahasa Arab; ada 28 huruf."],["Mengeja","Menyebut huruf dalam perkataan satu demi satu."]]},{"id":"t1-arab-kafa-2","nama":"Salam dan perkenalan","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Salam dan perkenalan"},{"j":"p","t":"Kita memberi salam dan memperkenalkan diri dalam bahasa Arab."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">السَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ</span> : salam sejahtera ke atas kamu","<span class=\"arab\">وَعَلَيْكُمُ السَّلَامُ</span> : dan ke atas kamu salam sejahtera","<span class=\"arab\">أَهْلًا</span> : selamat datang","<span class=\"arab\">اِسْمِي</span> : nama saya","<span class=\"arab\">أَنَا تِلْمِيذٌ</span> : saya murid lelaki","<span class=\"arab\">أَنَا تِلْمِيذَةٌ</span> : saya murid perempuan","<span class=\"arab\">مُعَلِّمٌ</span> : guru lelaki","<span class=\"arab\">مُعَلِّمَةٌ</span> : guru perempuan","<span class=\"arab\">مَنْ أَنْتَ؟</span> : siapakah kamu?","<span class=\"arab\">صَدِيقِي</span> : kawan saya"]},{"j":"h","t":"Nombor 1 hingga 5"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">وَاحِدٌ</span> : satu","<span class=\"arab\">اِثْنَانِ</span> : dua","<span class=\"arab\">ثَلَاثَةٌ</span> : tiga","<span class=\"arab\">أَرْبَعَةٌ</span> : empat","<span class=\"arab\">خَمْسَةٌ</span> : lima"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ingat"},{"j":"p","t":"Sebarkan salam sesama kita."}],"glosari":[["Tilmiz","Murid lelaki: <span class=\"arab\">تِلْمِيذٌ</span>"],["Muallim","Guru lelaki: <span class=\"arab\">مُعَلِّمٌ</span>"],["Ahlan","Selamat datang: <span class=\"arab\">أَهْلًا</span>"]]},{"id":"t1-arab-kafa-3","nama":"Sekolahku","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Sekolahku"},{"j":"p","t":"Kita belajar perkataan tentang sekolah dan kata tunjuk <span class=\"arab\">هٰذَا</span>, <span class=\"arab\">هٰذِهِ</span>, <span class=\"arab\">ذٰلِكَ</span> dan <span class=\"arab\">تِلْكَ</span>."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">مَدْرَسَةٌ</span> : sekolah","<span class=\"arab\">مُدِيرٌ</span> : guru besar","<span class=\"arab\">هٰذَا</span> : ini (lelaki)","<span class=\"arab\">هٰذِهِ</span> : ini (perempuan)","<span class=\"arab\">ذٰلِكَ</span> : itu (lelaki)","<span class=\"arab\">تِلْكَ</span> : itu (perempuan)","<span class=\"arab\">كَبِيرَةٌ</span> : besar","<span class=\"arab\">جَمِيلَةٌ</span> : cantik"]},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh ayat"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">هٰذِهِ مَدْرَسَتِي</span> : ini sekolah saya","<span class=\"arab\">مَدْرَسَتِي كَبِيرَةٌ وَجَمِيلَةٌ</span> : sekolah saya besar dan cantik","<span class=\"arab\">أُحِبُّ مَدْرَسَتِي</span> : saya sayang sekolah saya"]},{"j":"h","t":"Nombor 6 hingga 10"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">سِتَّةٌ</span> : enam","<span class=\"arab\">سَبْعَةٌ</span> : tujuh","<span class=\"arab\">ثَمَانِيَةٌ</span> : lapan","<span class=\"arab\">تِسْعَةٌ</span> : sembilan","<span class=\"arab\">عَشَرَةٌ</span> : sepuluh"]}],"glosari":[["Sekolah","Dalam bahasa Arab: مَدْرَسَةٌ"],["Guru besar","Dalam bahasa Arab: مُدِيرٌ"],["Ini (lelaki)","Dalam bahasa Arab: هٰذَا"],["Ini (perempuan)","Dalam bahasa Arab: هٰذِهِ"],["Itu (lelaki)","Dalam bahasa Arab: ذٰلِكَ"]]},{"id":"t1-arab-kafa-4","nama":"Alatan sekolah","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Alatan sekolah"},{"j":"p","t":"Kita belajar nama alatan sekolah dalam bahasa Arab."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">قَلَمٌ</span> : pen","<span class=\"arab\">كِتَابٌ</span> : buku","<span class=\"arab\">دَفْتَرٌ</span> : buku tulis","<span class=\"arab\">حَقِيبَةٌ</span> : beg","<span class=\"arab\">مِرْسَمٌ</span> : pensel","<span class=\"arab\">مِمْسَحَةٌ</span> : pemadam","<span class=\"arab\">مِسْطَرَةٌ</span> : pembaris","<span class=\"arab\">سَبُّورَةٌ</span> : papan tulis"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bertanya"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">هَلْ عِنْدَكَ قَلَمٌ؟</span> : adakah kamu ada pen?","<span class=\"arab\">نَعَمْ، عِنْدِي قَلَمٌ</span> : ya, saya ada pen"]},{"j":"h","t":"Nombor puluhan"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">عِشْرُونَ</span> : 20","<span class=\"arab\">ثَلَاثُونَ</span> : 30","<span class=\"arab\">خَمْسُونَ</span> : 50","<span class=\"arab\">مِائَةٌ</span> : 100"]}],"glosari":[["Pen","Dalam bahasa Arab: قَلَمٌ"],["Buku","Dalam bahasa Arab: كِتَابٌ"],["Buku tulis","Dalam bahasa Arab: دَفْتَرٌ"],["Beg","Dalam bahasa Arab: حَقِيبَةٌ"],["Pensel","Dalam bahasa Arab: مِرْسَمٌ"]]},{"id":"t1-arab-kafa-5","nama":"Hari dalam seminggu","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Hari dalam seminggu"},{"j":"p","t":"Seminggu ada tujuh hari. Dalam bahasa Arab, hari disebut dengan <span class=\"arab\">يَوْمُ</span>."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">يَوْمُ الْأَحَدِ</span> : hari